; Moves one variable: a DirectionalLight2D's reach. Three grey panels at light_mask 1, 2 and 0, the
; last at z_index 2000, all take the same warm light, since Godot runs every directional light over
; every lit item (`canvas.glsl:726`). The clear colour below them takes none. No other scene has a
; light without a cull mask, so a regression that culls a panel, or drops `color.a × energy`, shows
; only here.

